# ==============================================================================
# Environment Configuration (.env.example)
# ==============================================================================
#
# IMPORTANT CONFIGURATION SPLIT:
#
# 1. Build-time variables (consumed by Astro during `pnpm build`):
#    - PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY: Required at build time to render the Turnstile
#      widget in the Contact form.
#    - WARNING: A build created without PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY deployed against
#      a runtime that has TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY configured will cause all form
#      submissions to fail with "Bot verification token is missing".
#
# 2. Runtime variables (configured in Cloudflare Pages / Worker environment):
#    - RESEND_API_KEY: Secret key for sending emails via Resend.
#    - TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY: Secret key for verifying Cloudflare Turnstile tokens.
#    - CONTACT_TO_EMAIL: Destination inbox for contact submissions.
#    - CONTACT_FROM_EMAIL: Sender address verified in Resend.
# ==============================================================================

# [Build-time] Cloudflare Turnstile Public Site Key (Astro client bundle)
PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY="0x4AAAAAAAx-placeholder-site-key"

# [Runtime] Cloudflare Turnstile Secret Key (Cloudflare Pages function)
TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY="0x4AAAAAAAx-placeholder-secret-key"

# [Runtime] Resend API Key (Cloudflare Pages function)
RESEND_API_KEY="re_placeholder_secret_key"

# [Runtime] Contact Notification Routing
CONTACT_TO_EMAIL="your-inbox@example.com"
CONTACT_FROM_EMAIL="portfolio@yourdomain.com"
